flowchart LR
    subgraph INDEX[Knowledge-base indexing]
        F[PDF / DOCX / CSV / plain text] --> I[Ingestion<br/>validate and assign IDs]
        I --> X[Text extraction<br/>text + structure + source locations]
        X --> C[Chunking<br/>coherent passages]
        C --> E[Embedding model<br/>chunk text to vector]
        C --> M[Chunk text + source metadata]
        E --> V[(Vector database)]
        M --> V
    end

    subgraph QUERY[Question answering]
        Q[User question + project scope] --> QE[Query embedding]
        QE --> S[Similarity search<br/>with project/access filters]
        V --> S
        S --> R[Context retrieval<br/>rank, select, deduplicate]
        R --> G[Context with source citations]
        Q --> L[LLM response generation]
        G --> L
        L --> A[Grounded answer<br/>with citations and uncertainty]
    end
